   Welcome to the Haibane RenmeiOS live environment.

   You are logged in as root (getty autologin, no password).
   The live ISO boots to this text console by design — please do
   NOT start SDDM here (the live root account is locked for
   graphical logins).

   ── First steps ─────────────────────────────────────────────
   • See the branded prompt:           fastfetch
   • Wallpapers for your desktop & the Shadow Shell picker:
     ~/Pictures/Wallpapers/   (Rakka, the haibane cast, the sketch)
   • Install Haibane RenmeiOS to disk: archinstall
   • In the installed system: sudo systemctl enable --now sddm NetworkManager
   • In your installed system (as your user): haibane-setup
     installs Hyprland + Shadow Shell — fully offline, no network needed
